		<title>Why Madonna is a great role model for the awkward and insecure teenagers</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/why-madonna-is-a-great-role-model-for-the-awkward-and-insecure-teenagers/20150819</link>
		<comments>http://drownedmadonna.com/why-madonna-is-a-great-role-model-for-the-awkward-and-insecure-teenagers/20150819#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2015 17:09:18 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Dexter]]></dc:creator>
