				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>It’s been more than two decades since the <strong>Queen of Pop</strong> performed live in Australia, but the 56-year-old has finally confirmed Australian dates as part of her <strong>Rebel Heart World Tour</strong>. <strong>Madonna</strong> will visit Melbourne, Sydney and Brisbane in March 2016, with two dates in each city, her first Australian tour since <em>The Girlie Show </em>in 1993.<span id="more-25786"></span></p>
<p>In celebration of the announcement, the <a href="http://dailyreview.crikey.com.au/madonnas-10-most-iconic-live-performances/25786" target="_blank">Daily Review</a> went back through the archives to pick their 10 favourite (and arguably the most iconic) <strong>Madonna</strong> performances. Check it out. Do you agree with this top 10?</p>
<p><strong>The virgin bride</strong></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/jbmszeK5-L4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><strong>Vogue, Dangerous Liaisons-style</strong></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/lTaXtWWR16A?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><strong>Hung Up at Confessions</strong></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/XoDPKAGW-vg?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><strong>Express Yourself at Blond Ambition</strong></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/nebRhxG2dKk?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><strong>Channelling Marilyn at the Oscars</strong></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/a9V2FaioZSE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><strong>Live to Tell, crucified</strong></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/2JvK3U2gpsQ?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><strong>Frozen at the Drowned World Tour</strong></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/YdgRzt5u_VM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
